{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]A shepherd had [F]a hun[G]dred sheep
[C]He counted them [F]before [C]his sleep
Nine-ty-sev-[F]en, nine-[G]ty-[Am]eight
Nine-ty-nine, [G]but wait, [C]wait, [F]wait
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Nine-ty-nine and [C]one, nine-ty-nine and [G]one
